  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Performs sphere map texture composition with selectable blend modes.

    Samples
    a sphere map or sub-texture using a chosen UV layer, extracts an optional mask,
    and blends the result with base and diffuse inputs using add, multiply, subtract,
    or disabled modes.

    Designed for MMD-style SPH/SPA effects and stylized lighting
    pipelines.'
